{"2745670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SCP", "steam_appid": 2745670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &quot;SCP,&quot; an intense open-world survival-craft experience set in a post-apocalyptic realm where the enigmatic SCP entities roam freely. Brace yourself for a relentless struggle for survival as you navigate through a desolate landscape filled with anomalies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745670/extras/cd1545d8d59aad32da78c27e902705a0.poster.avif?t=1787383480\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745670/extras/cd1545d8d59aad32da78c27e902705a0.webm?t=1787383480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745670/extras/cd1545d8d59aad32da78c27e902705a0.mp4?t=1787383480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**DYNAMIC OPEN WORLD:** Explore a dynamic world, where each corner holds dangers and resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745670/extras/2d2660dbad31fb16cd44fd1c8751a166.poster.avif?t=1787383480\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745670/extras/2d2660dbad31fb16cd44fd1c8751a166.webm?t=1787383480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**NIGHTFALL TERROR:** As the sun sets, brace yourself for a different kind of danger. The creations of SCP-049, zombie-like creatures, emerge to hunt the living. Will you risk the darkness for valuable resources, or hunker down and fortify your position until dawn? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745670/extras/9f1b65f4bf73fe88ba533fd9211169de.poster.avif?t=1787383480\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745670/extras/9f1b65f4bf73fe88ba533fd9211169de.webm?t=1787383480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**SCP ENTITIES:** Encounter  SCP entities with unique abilities and characteristics. Learn to adapt and use their drops to your advantage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745670/extras/4bfcd2efcd7cc8af24429a999887953f.poster.avif?t=1787383480\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745670/extras/4bfcd2efcd7cc8af24429a999887953f.webm?t=1787383480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745670/extras/4bfcd2efcd7cc8af24429a999887953f.mp4?t=1787383480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**BASE BUILDING AND CRAFTING:** Establish your stronghold amidst the chaos. Collect resources, craft essential tools, and construct shelters to withstand the nightmarish onslaught. Customize your base to suit your survival strategy, as you prepare for the horrors that await after sundown.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &quot;SCP,&quot; an intense open-world survival-craft experience set in a post-apocalyptic realm where the enigmatic SCP entities roam freely. Brace yourself for a relentless struggle for survival as you navigate through a desolate landscape filled with anomalies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745670/extras/cd1545d8d59aad32da78c27e902705a0.poster.avif?t=1787383480\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745670/extras/cd1545d8d59aad32da78c27e902705a0.webm?t=1787383480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745670/extras/cd1545d8d59aad32da78c27e902705a0.mp4?t=1787383480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**DYNAMIC OPEN WORLD:** Explore a dynamic world, where each corner holds dangers and resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745670/extras/2d2660dbad31fb16cd44fd1c8751a166.poster.avif?t=1787383480\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745670/extras/2d2660dbad31fb16cd44fd1c8751a166.webm?t=1787383480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**NIGHTFALL TERROR:** As the sun sets, brace yourself for a different kind of danger. The creations of SCP-049, zombie-like creatures, emerge to hunt the living. Will you risk the darkness for valuable resources, or hunker down and fortify your position until dawn? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745670/extras/9f1b65f4bf73fe88ba533fd9211169de.poster.avif?t=1787383480\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745670/extras/9f1b65f4bf73fe88ba533fd9211169de.webm?t=1787383480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**SCP ENTITIES:** Encounter  SCP entities with unique abilities and characteristics. Learn to adapt and use their drops to your advantage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745670/extras/4bfcd2efcd7cc8af24429a999887953f.poster.avif?t=1787383480\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745670/extras/4bfcd2efcd7cc8af24429a999887953f.webm?t=1787383480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745670/extras/4bfcd2efcd7cc8af24429a999887953f.mp4?t=1787383480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**BASE BUILDING AND CRAFTING:** Establish your stronghold amidst the chaos. Collect resources, craft essential tools, and construct shelters to withstand the nightmarish onslaught. Customize your base to suit your survival strategy, as you prepare for the horrors that await after sundown.</p>", "short_description": "Explore, craft, and survive in a post-apocalyptic world where SCP anomalies roam freely. Brace yourself for nightly assaults as SCP-049's twisted creations close in.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745670/header.jpg?t=1787383480", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st